  "description": "Taeha, who works as a cook at a restaurant, always lives alone without anyone approaching him due to his bully-like impression. Then one day, he meets Joowon, a part-time worker, at a cafe he went to on a coffee errand, and unlike himself, there are many people around him and he feels a feeling of admiration for him for being kind. In the end, he secretly takes pictures or spies on social media, and he becomes more and more of a stalker and soon gets caught by Joo Won... Taeha, who works as a cook at a restaurant, has the impression of a gangster.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/stalking), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/starts_with_stalking), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000069093), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12391605) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/stalking), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/stalking)  \nJapanese: [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/stalking), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.jp/comic/stalking)",
